OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain
OL,6,Fcontinuing across the far north
OL,7,Ftonight, with scattered showers
OL,8,Felsewhere gradually fading. Remaining
OL,9,Fmostly dry towards eastern England,
OL,10,Fwith the clearest skies here, A warm
OL,11,Fnight in the south and east but more
OL,12,Fcomfortable elsewhere.
